 on their own</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"70\" width=\"230\" height=\"170\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#d9c48f\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"262\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"262\" stroke=\"#9e9e9e\" stroke-width=\"10\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Public road</text><g transform=\"translate(220 80) scale(-0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(190 70) scale(-0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(160 64) scale(-0.45 0.45)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"50.0\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"70.0,50.0 79.5,46.8 78.4,55.4\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">to roost</text><text x=\"265\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Never bump them (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Let them leave on their own. Never bump them.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Scouting step 4: with the landowner&#x27;s permission, walk the spot and find where fresh droppings and feathers are thickest. That is the X, 65 percent.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Scout 4: with permission, find the X</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"70\" width=\"230\" height=\"170\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#d9c48f\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"262\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"262\" stroke=\"#9e9e9e\" stroke-width=\"10\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Public road</text><g transform=\"translate(240 120) rotate(0) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(277 143) rotate(40) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(314 166) rotate(80) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(261 189) rotate(120) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(298 142) rotate(160) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(245 165) rotate(20) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(282 188) rotate(60) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(319 141) rotate(100) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(266 164) rotate(140) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(303 187) rotate(0) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(250 140) rotate(40) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(287 163) rotate(80) scale(0.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-5\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#6b8e23\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"-5\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f5f5\"/><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M-12 -2 L4 -2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".7\"/></g><circle cx=\"285\" cy=\"150\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"285\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">X</text><text x=\"265\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Thickest fresh droppings (65%)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>4.</b> With permission, find the thickest fresh droppings.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Scouting step 5: plan your hide on the X or in cover within 45 to 90 metres, 50 to 100 yards, with the wind at your back, 65 percent.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Scout 5: plan the hide on or beside the X</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"70\" width=\"230\" height=\"170\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#d9c48f\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"262\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"262\" stroke=\"#9e9e9e\" stroke-width=\"10\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Public road</text><circle cx=\"285\" cy=\"150\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"285\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">X</text><g transform=\"translate(200 150) scale(1.2)\"><rect x=\"-22\" y=\"-8\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#d9c48f\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"240.0\" y2=\"95.0\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"240.0,95.0 229.2,100.2 229.2,89.8\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wind</text><text x=\"265\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cover within 45 to 90 m</text><text x=\"265\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(50 to 100 yd) (65%)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>5.</b> Plan the hide on the X or in cover nearby.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>They usually return to yesterday afternoon's field <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full scouting method</summary><ul><li>Geese usually return to the previous afternoon's feeding spot in the morning (65%, Ducks Unlimited goose guide, Wade Bourne).</li><li>Wait until the flock flies to roost, walk out (with permission), check for fresh droppings, and save the spot on your GPS (Global Positioning System) or as a Spot on the Hunt Map <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Set up in cover 45 to 90 m (50 to 100 yd) off the X if the X itself is bare; hunting from cover often beats lying on the exact spot (65%, Casey Self, Ducks Unlimited guide).</li><li>Scout where you can see without trespassing: use the \"What can I see from here\" tool. See <a href=\"#/s/mc-geese-07\">Chapter 7</a>.</li><li>Law: no loaded gun in or on a vehicle while you scout; no shooting from a vehicle or in the <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Road allowance\">Road allowance</button> (99%, quick lesson rules).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation, map view. Morning: three geese fly from the roost lake along a curved line to a stubble field. Evening: they fly the same line back to the roost. Tip: watch the line for 2 evenings before you hunt it.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Same roost, same line, same field</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/><ellipse cx=\"70\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#9fc3e0\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Roost lake</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"70\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#d9c48f\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Field</text><path id=\"mgs-flight-line-p\" d=\"M90 185 C 150 150, 220 120, 315 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 6\"/><path id=\"mgs-flight-line-q\" d=\"M315 110 C 220 120, 150 150, 90 185\" fill=\"none\"/><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"0s\"/><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"0\" begin=\"4s\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 0) scale(0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"0s\" fill=\"freeze\" rotate=\"auto\"><mpath href=\"#mgs-flight-line-p\"/></animateMotion></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"5s\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 0) scale(0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"5s\" fill=\"freeze\" rotate=\"auto\"><mpath href=\"#mgs-flight-line-q\"/></animateMotion></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"0.3s\"/><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"0\" begin=\"4.3s\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 0) scale(0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\" rotate=\"auto\"><mpath href=\"#mgs-flight-line-p\"/></animateMotion></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"5.3s\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 0) scale(0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"5.3s\" fill=\"freeze\" rotate=\"auto\"><mpath href=\"#mgs-flight-line-q\"/></animateMotion></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"0.6s\"/><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"0\" begin=\"4.6s\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 0) scale(0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"0.6s\" fill=\"freeze\" rotate=\"auto\"><mpath href=\"#mgs-flight-line-p\"/></animateMotion></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"5.6s\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 0) scale(0.5 0.5)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -2 L36 -4 L36 1 L16 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"-2\" rx=\"6\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M45 -3 L51 -1 L45 1Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -3 L6 -30 L12 -3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-20 0 L-28 -3 L-28 3Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" begin=\"5.6s\" fill=\"freeze\" rotate=\"auto\"><mpath href=\"#mgs-flight-line-q\"/></animateMotion></g><g opacity=\"1\"><text x=\"200\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Morning: roost to field</text><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"0\" begin=\"4.6s\"/></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"4.6s\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evening: field to roost</text></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Watch it 2 evenings before you hunt (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Follow the line, not the birds. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Drive the roads ahead of the flock, stop, glass (Tip).</li><li>Note time, field, wind and count in your Journal (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to do it</summary><ul><li>Goose flocks fly kilometres between roost and field. Use binoculars and public roads; never follow a flock across private land (99% on trespass).</li><li>Note the direction they leave the roost and the time. Next evening wait farther along that line (Tip).</li><li>A flock that circles and lands in the same field two days running is your best bet (Tip, 65%).</li><li>Keep a record: date, time, field, wind, flock size. After a season you will know your fields better than any book (Tip). See <a href=\"#/s/hunt-journal-guide\">Journal guide</a>.</li></ul></details>","<aside class=\"callout tip\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Memory rhymes (made for this app)</div><ul><li>\"Green and wet, the best bet. Dry and white, not tonight.\"</li><li>\"Glass at dusk, find the X; set at dawn, take the next.\"</li><li>\"Three toes webbed, ten cm long: a goose walked here and moved along.\"</li></ul></aside><ul><li>Number trick: <strong>10, 10, 1.5</strong>. Track about 10 cm, droppings up to 10 cm, about 1.5 hours from grass to dropping (65 to 70%).</li></ul><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Old hand's rule (tradition, opinion)</div><p>Never bump the birds when you scout. Watch them leave, then walk the field. Standard advice in goose hunting guides.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Ducks Unlimited goose guide, naturalist track and scat notes, Wildfowl journal, Hinterland Who's Who. Checked 2026-10-11.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: every source and date checked</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.ducks.org/hunting/goose-hunting-tips-tactics/the-ultimate-guide-to-hunting-canada-geese\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ducks Unlimited goose guide</a>, read directly 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.pei-untamed.com/post/canada-goose-tracks-and-scat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PEI Untamed, Canada goose tracks and scat</a> and <a href=\"https://www.crittercontrol.com/wildlife/geese/goose-tracks/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Critter Control, goose tracks</a>, search previews 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://icwdm.org/species/birds/canada-geese/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Internet Center for Wildlife Damage Management</a>, read directly 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://wildfowl.wwt.org.uk/index.php/wildfowl/article/view/927\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wildfowl journal, food throughput time</a>, search preview 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.ducks.org/hunting/waterfowl-id/canada-goose\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ducks Unlimited ID pages</a>, read directly 2026-10-11 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Full log: <code>research/2026-10-11-masterclass-geese.md</code>.</li></ul></details>"]